 "name_en": "Bank Fee Management (2O0)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Bank Fee Management (2O0)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe50055ee7a46401994c2a7d8169341ce\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe50055ee7a46401994c2a7d8169341ce__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item provides comprehensive functionalities in bank fee management, such as the maintenance of the bank fee conditions and monitoring and validation of the bank fees.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You start by importing the bank service billing files into the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> system. You then create, edit, or delete the bank fee calculation conditions in the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> system per the agreements you have with the banks and assign them to the corresponding bank fee items. You check the bank fees in different views or dimensions and with different detail levels. You can also validate them based on the assigned conditions and set the validation status accordingly.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe50055ee7a46401994c2a7d8169341ce__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Import bank service billing files</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check bank fee conditions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create bank fee conditions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Edit bank fee conditions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Delete bank fee conditions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor bank fees in different views, dimensions, and detail levels</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assign bank fee conditions to bank fee items</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Validate the bank fee items and set validation status accordingly</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe50055ee7a46401994c2a7d8169341ce__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase transparency on the bank fee condition agreements with the banks</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase transparency on the bank fee check and validation processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase control over the bank charge accuracy</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>银行费用管理 (2O0)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe50055ee7a46401994c2a7d8169341ce\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe50055ee7a46401994c2a7d8169341ce__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目提供银行费用管理的全面功能，例如银行费用条件的维护以及银行费用的监控和验证。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">首先将银行服务开票文件导入 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 系统。然后，您可以根据与银行签订的协议在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 系统中创建、编辑或删除银行费用计算条件，并将其分配到相应的银行费用项目。您可以在不同的视图或维度中使用不同的详细信息级别检查银行费用。您还可以根据分配的条件对其进行验证，并相应地设置验证状态。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe50055ee7a46401994c2a7d8169341ce__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">导入银行服务开票文件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查银行费用条件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建银行费用条件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">编辑银行费用条件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">删除银行费用条件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在不同视图、维度和详细信息级别监控银行费用</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将银行费用条件分配到银行费用项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">验证银行费用项目，并相应地设置验证状态</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe50055ee7a46401994c2a7d8169341ce__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">提高与银行的银行费用条件协议的透明度。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高银行费用检查和验证流程的透明度。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">加强对银行手续费准确性的控制</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
